# ITSM Analysis

An example of survival modeling with KMDS using the ITSM ticket dataset is available in this repository. See the survival pipeline creation notebook and the KM model creation notebook for a complete Kaplan-Meier workflow.

- [Create ITSM Survival Pipeline](notebooks/create_itsm_survival_pipeline.ipynb)
- [Create ITSM Survival Kaplan-Meier Model](notebooks/create_itsm_survival_kaplan_meier_model.ipynb)
